DarkArchmage: {
	DisplayName: Dark Archmage
	BestiaryEntry1: Originating from the Shade World, they are one of the few sentient beings with a will. They are frightened and disoriented by how bright it is here, and lash out at the slightest disturbance.
}

TenebrousConstruct: {
	DisplayName: Tenebrous Construct
	InternalName: TenebrousConstruct
	BestiaryEntry1: A delusional zealot perched eternally at Mother Darkness's side, this deceitful construct sacrifcied its humanity for immortality and power.
	SpawnDialogue0: Hello. Local.
	SpawnDialogue1: I bet you’ve had plenty of work on your hands tracking down and destroying all of the attendants here in your world.
	SpawnDialogue2: I have been tasked with ending your interference.
	SpawnDialogue3: But I wouldn’t dare let your final moments be so dour.
	SpawnDialogue4: So let me tell you a tale, Local.
	FightDialogue0: Long ago, our worlds were not too different.
	FightDialogue1: By now, our world has long lost its name. You call it ‘the shade world’. I call it Home.
	FightDialogue2: I and my kind lived a simple life, much like yours.
	FightDialogue3: We farmed. We played. We fought. We changed.
	FightDialogue4: Such glorified idiocy masquerades as a proper and just existence.
	FightDialogue5: Thankfully, descending from the heavens was our saviour.
	FightDialogue6: SHE razed our statues. SHE brought a bitter, eternal winter to Home. SHE elevated us to sentience by stripping all of our primitive nonsense away.
	FightDialogue7: Those who did not fight were not hurt, and I was among the earliest defectors of my people.
	FightDialogue8: My eagerness proved a valuable asset.
	FightDialogue9: I watched my people fall in droves at HER hand, trying to protect what remained of our past.
	FightDialogue10: What fools they were. They were blind, and could not see that the future lay with Mother Darkness, as we had all come to call her.
	FightDialogue11: What I lost in flesh, I gained in power. The less like my people I looked, the more she appreciated my presence.
	FightDialogue12: Before long, I was among her most-tolerated presences.
	FightDialogue13: While the rest of my people starved and froze out in the never-ending nighttime, I stayed in the palace, where I lived lavishly as Mother Darkness’s errand doer.
	FightDialogue14: Life had struck a nice balance, if I do say so.
	FightDialogue15: Jeez, you're really tiring me out! Just go away already! No more storytime!
	FightDialogue16: You've done enough meddling with her plans! If she wants this world, she will have it!
	FightDialogue17: Give up! I'll just keep getting sent here until I succeed!
	FightDialogue18: You better stop!
	FightDialogue19: NO!!
	FightDialogue20: Ow Im dead

	Fables: {
		Name: Tenebrous Construct
		Title: Devout Official
	}
}

