BlackTwister: {
	DisplayName: Black Twister
	BestiaryEntry1: It only takes a little spark to gather riften silt grains into a whirlwinded mess!
}

SunscorchedDjinn: {
	DisplayName: Sunscorched Djinn
	BestiaryEntry1:
		'''
		Djinns traditionally come trapped in a lantern, offering 3 wishes, the whole jig.
		But these zippy spirits reside not in a lamp, but rather, a teapot. Why? Because these roaming assailants are former peoples of the desert that were enfatuated with tea!
		Tea with all 4 meals of the day, tea as a ceremonial drink, tea as a medicine!
		That said, they don't tend to remember much else about their past lives, and choose to spend their time playing games or reveling in the fun of attacking travelers that pass by their domain.
		'''
}

